"""Glossary of wording ("Словарь формулировок"): how Russian-side and Ukrainian-side media name the same things.
Curated by hand (no LLM). Each entry: terms per side (as displayed, per page language), the neutral wording used by independent
outlets, a short neutral note, and regexes used by build.py to find REAL examples in the source articles behind published cards
(ru = Russian-side outlets, ua = Ukrainian-side outlets, ind = independent outlets). Entries without any example are not shown.
Descriptive only: the page documents usage, it does not judge which side is right."""

def T(ru, uk, en): return dict(ru=ru, uk=uk, en=en)

